__pycache__/
*.py[oc]
/build/
dist/
wheels/
*.egg-info

.coverage
.coverage/
.coverage/*

# Virtual environments
.venv
**/.env
**/uipath.db
**/.uipath
**/**.nupkg
**/__uipath/

**/playground.py
**/.idea

**/docs/plugins/*
